{"file": "C:/Users/Garrett/Sports/docs/arxiv-program/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0600-a-new-unified-method-for-detecting.md", "equation": "2. **Bayesian skin detection:** prior P(skin) = MODE(Avg cluster)/(MODE(Avg)+MODE(Max)) (eq. 10); conditional from repeated-pixel counts in 3×3 windows; posterior P(skin|window) (eq. 11) with threshold ≥ 0.50, applied at pixel level (Max+Avg clusters) and component level (morphological grouping of nearest neighbors) across temporal frames. Skin components merged via nearest-neighbor into a seed region.", "page_or_eqnum": null, "wave": 9128}
