{"file": "C:/Users/Garrett/Sports/docs/arxiv-program/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0679-parity-and-predictability-of-competitions.md", "equation": "Cumulative master equation (Eq. A2): dGk/dt = q(G_{k−1} − Gk) + (1/2 − q)(G²_{k−1} − G²_k), with G_0 = 0, G_∞ = 1, Gk(0) = 1 for k > 0. Summing gives mean wins ⟨k⟩ = t/2.", "page_or_eqnum": null, "wave": 9128}
